<title>BRAZIL: Brazil to reveal Feb monetary base data.</title>
<headline>Brazil to reveal Feb monetary base data.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Central Bank will reveal monetary base data, public sector debt levels and the latest fiscal deficit figures at 1100 local/1400 GMT, a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>((-- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom 55-61-2230358))</p>
</text>
